doc:Factsarticle_1_26 schema:abstract "Nonlinear vibration phenomena, such as oil whirl and oil whip, are indicators of oil film instability in hydrodynamic bearings and signs of potential faults in rotating machinery. This paper presents a nonlinear dynamic coefficient model for monitoring and predicting oil film instability." .
_:c85fabf0b184bd61667b2687a56012b5 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsarticle_1_26 schema:abstract "Nonlinear vibration phenomena, such as oil whirl and oil whip, are indicators of oil film instability in hydrodynamic bearings and signs of potential faults in rotating machinery. This paper presents a nonlinear dynamic coefficient model for monitoring and predicting oil film instability." )>> ;
